          <h1>Plans &amp; billing</h1>
          <p>Quickler is priced per firm, not per seat. Pick the plan that fits the number of engineers you have.</p>

          <h2>Plans</h2>
          <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.1);">
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:6px 4px;">Plan</th>
                <th style="text-align:right;padding:6px 4px;">Engineers</th>
                <th style="text-align:right;padding:6px 4px;">Workflows</th>
                <th style="text-align:right;padding:6px 4px;">Per month</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Starter</td><td style="text-align:right;">1</td><td style="text-align:right;">3</td><td style="text-align:right;">&pound;50</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Team</td><td style="text-align:right;">4</td><td style="text-align:right;">5</td><td style="text-align:right;">&pound;100</td></tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);"><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Business</td><td style="text-align:right;">12</td><td style="text-align:right;">8</td><td style="text-align:right;">&pound;140</td></tr>
              <tr><td style="padding:6px 4px;">Scale</td><td style="text-align:right;">30</td><td style="text-align:right;">10</td><td style="text-align:right;">&pound;300</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <h2>Payment</h2>
          <p>We collect by <strong>Direct Debit</strong>. You authorise once; we draw monthly from your bank account. No card numbers stored. You're protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee &mdash; refunds are immediate if anything goes wrong.</p>

          <h2>Upgrading</h2>
          <p>Hit a limit and the dashboard prompts you to upgrade. You pay the pro-rata difference for the rest of the current cycle; the new price applies from the next one.</p>

          <h2>Downgrading</h2>
          <p>Remove engineers until you fit within the lower plan, then accept the downgrade prompt. New price takes effect next cycle.</p>

          <h2>Cancelling</h2>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@quickler.co">hello@quickler.co</a>. Your subscription ends at the next billing date. Export your data first &mdash; see <a href="/pages/help/privacy.html">Data &amp; privacy</a>.</p>

          <h2>Invoices</h2>
          <p>Every payment generates an invoice emailed to your primary admin. Need a historical one resent? Email support.</p>
          <hr style="margin-top:40px;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
